Hi Chiara,

I think the issue you are having is that you have labeled your egoIDcol ?egoIDcol?, but when you call it in your code you have it labeled ?egoID?.  If you change 

 

egodata(ego, alters=alter, egoIDcol = "egoID")

NB.network<-as.egodata(ego, alters=alter, egoIDcol = "egoID")

 

to

 

egodata(ego, alters=alter, egoIDcol = " egoIDcol ")

NB.network<-as.egodata(ego, alters=alter, egoIDcol = " egoIDcol ")

 

That should help. 

 

-Deven

 

